# NOTE: intentionally NOT ignoring "storage" here - that name collides with
# the real source directory src/server/storage/. A bare `storage` entry
# excludes any directory with that name at any depth, which silently broke
# the Docker build (see CLAUDE_PROGRESS.md). The local dev media directory
# at the repo root gets copied into the image if present, which only costs
# a little image size - a correctness bug is worse than that.
